 "title": "GTA 6 already has a perfect rating, and it isn't out yet",
 "audio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3Lh3gaSoJDsjYAzqFyj65XamsxE/hf_20261115_053235_637b4621-20c1-40f8-9861-c520db68f303.wav",
 "script": "GTA 6 already has a perfect five star rating, and it isn't even out yet. The Xbox Store reportedly shows 5 out of 5 from nearly 10,000 ratings. On PlayStation, 12 early ratings average 4.67. Here's the catch. These are store ratings, not critic reviews, and nobody has shown those players finished the game. The real review embargo is rumored for November 18, but Rockstar hasn't confirmed it. Take-Two's boss says Rockstar games usually score in the mid 90s. So what's your Metacritic guess? Comment your number.",
